{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"绝对值"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"“绝对值”"},2],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>绝对值是到 $\\mathbb{R}_{\\geq 0}$ 的保持乘法的函数.</p>\n<h2>相关概念</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"赋值环","text":"赋值环"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}